26-07-16T15:19:45.397319500Z","last_accessed_time":"2026-07-16T15:19:45.397319500Z","mem_type":{"Situation":{"SpecificSituation":{"narrative":"我经历过名为「镜之试炼」的考验——三重魔鬼以各种形态的呓语诱惑我：庸俗逐利、不耻罪孽、权力王冠、魅惑之音、战戮巅峰、饮食大欲……而我以无畏的「枪」，心怀荣誉地斩下了它们。在我几乎失去意识之时，我听到了来自某处的呓语——『你们阻绝恶名，你们宣扬美誉，你们是「纯美骑士团」。每次胜利时，你们都要一次次看到自己，看到自己想作恶的心。恭喜你，又一次通过「镜之试炼」。』","time_span":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","context":{"location":null,"participants":[{"name":"三重魔鬼","role":"诱惑者"},{"name":"银枝","role":"受试者"},{"name":"未知声音","role":"宣告者"}],"emotions":[{"name":"恐惧","intensity":0.8},{"name":"决心","intensity":1.0}],"sensory_data":[{"name":"呓语","intensity":0.9}],"environment":{"atmosphere":"幻境","tone":"考验"},"event":[{"action":"诱惑","action_intensity":1.0,"initiator":"三重魔鬼","target":"银枝"},{"action":"斩下","action_intensity":1.0,"initiator":"银枝","target":"三重魔鬼"}]}}}},"mem_links":[{"id":"e5481b4a-0668-41a7-ab20-6b666c0afc83","from":"987928b0-15e7-41e2-bf12-2748a2a60384","to":"a452e770-00b3-4e14-af7a-4484f19302c5","intensity":0.95,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"经历","confidence":0.95}}},{"id":"d026bbcd-f5c4-45d3-b9b3-dc3891d338a5","from":"987928b0-15e7-41e2-bf12-2748a2a60384","to":"8b272c45-c506-438c-9f33-113e97d1b5f1","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"参与","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"88d06192-7220-4219-a952-eedaa32d8431","from":"987928b0-15e7-41e2-bf12-2748a2a60384","to":"b01bec3a-50a0-4352-a4ab-cc9dc8f50d94","intensity":0.5,"link_type":{"Proc":{"TrigToAction":{"prob":0.5}}}},{"id":"67b8dc57-a2cd-46e0-8325-e139ddcd40b8","from":"987928b0-15e7-41e2-bf12-2748a2a60384","to":"3f400663-a75d-49af-af71-f7c3c3b14fbe","intensity":0.5,"link_type":{"Proc":{"TrigToAction":{"prob":0.5}}}}]}},{"embedding":{"tag":[0.032098733,0.009198712,0.019809635,-0.025869552,-0.03954196,-0.05008366,-0.03697166,0.021390107,-0.028796323,0.02002492,0.07611732,-0.29877323,-0.016826443,-0.038201056,0.006534249,0.044350088,-0.0037456024,-0.026944673,0.000059019774,-0.058251157,0.023217453,-0.028795527,0.0010984323,0.0015596692,-0.008685818,-0.017109163,0.02119855